AI Agent for WhatsApp — n8n Workflow
Builder: Rodrigo Espinosa Quinteros
Type: n8n Agentic Workflow
Status: Active production deployment
Trigger: Event-driven (WhatsApp webhook)
Domain: Conversational AI, Coaching Sales, CRM Automation

Overview
A fully agentic WhatsApp assistant that handles inbound conversations end-to-end:
detects user intent, retrieves relevant coaching content from a Google Sheet knowledge
base, generates personalized responses, and logs every interaction to a CRM — all
in real time, without human intervention.
Unlike the scheduled PR monitoring workflow, this system is reactive and stateful.
It responds to live user messages, remembers the last 15 turns of each conversation,
and makes tool-calling decisions dynamically based on what the user says.
The agent is designed to feel like a human advisor — it uses the user's name, speaks
informally, never identifies itself as AI, and closes every qualified conversation with
a Calendly booking link.

